You have a few possibilities.  Someone already mentioned engraving (you
*do* have magicbane, right?)  This will keep Demogorgon from whacking you,
which means you can actually attack rather than curing sickness all the
time.

My personal favorite is to get all the remaining named demons to follow
you down the stairs, then zap a spell of cone of cold (at expert) on top
of yourself or one of them (depending on where they're standing.)  Two
shots of this should take Orcus, and the third should take Demogorgon as
well.  If you end up on the stairs, they can't even run away :)  If
they're lined up, magic missile also does a lot of damage (especially with
a bounce).

Also consider #invoking the Eye to jump to another part of the dungeon,
where you can prepare better.  Then when you come down to the level where
Orcus and Demo are waiting, you'll most likely be standing on the up
stairs (unless one of them was there when you left.)  Have some !oFH, your
blessed unicorn horn, and all your spells ready, and engrave if you can.

Finally, consider a scroll of earth.  If there's only one spot next to
you, only one of them can attack at a time.  Hopefully it's Orcus ;)



